<div class="prose page-pad">
  <h1>Shipping &amp; returns</h1>
  <h2>Shipping</h2>
  <p>Standard delivery arrives in 3–5 business days ($4.95, free over $75). Express
  delivery arrives in 1–2 business days ($12.95). Every order gets a confirmation email,
  and another when it ships.</p>
  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>If something isn't right, you have 30 days from delivery to send it back in its original
  condition for a refund. Refunds are issued through the original payment method once the item
  reaches us.</p>
  <h2>Backorders</h2>
  <p>Items marked "backordered" ship in 2–3 weeks. You won't be charged until a backordered
  payment settles, and cancelling before then is always free.</p>
</div>
